Based on artificial intelligence and cloud-native technologies, AnyShare Family 7 is an Intelligent Content Management Platform for massive unstructured data. It helps organizations to eliminate data silos,  to achieve efficient collaboration, lifecycle security and knowledge inheritance. 
What’s new in AnyShare Family 7?
∙Provide Intelligent content services to improve organization productivity; 
∙Multiple products satisfy the need of content management, on premises or on cloud, from any size of organization; 
∙Modern architecture offers the best experience; 
∙An open platform supports wide application integration; 
∙Flexible deployment supports on-prem deployment, cloud deployment and hybrid deployment.

JuLinker, a HD cloud video conference software independently developed by Hisense JUHAOKAN Technology Co., Ltd. for
global individuals and enterprises, provides users with low-latency, high-quality audio and video services and real-time
sharing and interaction capabilities. Covering conference terminals, smart TVs, PCs, and mobile phones, and supporting
rapid deployment from cloud to end, it can provide complete solutions for corporate office, online education, and
telemedicine. JuLinker App provides mobile users with high-definition and stable video conferencing services, which
can seamlessly connect with various types of terminals. Every registered user will automatically get free time. Whether
in the office or on a business trip, they can easily initiate and join meetings anytime, anywhere. JuLinker strives to
bring you a better video conferencing experience, if you think it is good, please give us a praise ~ welcome to write
comments to encourage us ~

Core Services:
1. Host a Meeting, Log in, you can host a meeting for free, simple and convenient operation;
2. Join a Meeting, One tap join through the meeting ID, or click the invitation link to join quickly;
3. Schedule a Meeting, Meeting can be booked in advance according to the schedule, arrange the meeting not in a hurry;
4. Share Screen, Viewing the sharing of other attendees, and don't miss any wonderful moment;
5. Meeting Control, Abundant meeting management and control functions, support the audio and video access control of attendees to ensure the orderly progress of the meeting;
6. Interact, Support a variety of interactive communication methods such as chatting and raising hands in the meeting;
7. Real-time subtitles, simultaneous interpretation, Real-time subtitles can be opened to support simultaneous Chinese-English interpretation
